{"path":"io/basic_filebuf/basic_filebuf","title":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::basic_filebuf","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_filebuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>basic_filebuf","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/basic_filebuf","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs new std::basic_filebuf object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_filebuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_filebuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_filebuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs new <code>std::basic_filebuf</code> object.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Constructs a <code>std::basic_filebuf</code> object, initializing the base class by calling the default constructor of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\">std::basic_streambuf</a></span>. The created <code>basic_filebuf</code> is not associated with a file, and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/is_open\">is_open()</a></span> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The copy constructor is deleted; <code>std::basic_filebuf</code> is not <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CopyConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CopyConstructible</em></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Move-constructs a <code>std::basic_filebuf</code> object by moving all contents from another <code>std::basic_filebuf</code> object <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>, including the buffers, the associated file, the locale, the openmode, the is_open variable, and all other state. After move, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> is not associated with a file and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>. The member pointers of the base class <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\">std::basic_streambuf</a></span> of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> and of the base class of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> are guaranteed to point to different buffers (unless null).</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>basic_filebuf</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Typically called by the constructor of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream\">std::basic_fstream</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns a <code>basic_filebuf</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/~basic_filebuf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs a <code>basic_filebuf</code> object and closes the file if it is open <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_filebuf","title":"std::basic_filebuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::basic_filebuf","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Constructs new std::basic_filebuf object."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Notes","note":"Typically called by the constructor of std::basic_fstream."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns a basic_filebuf object"},{"label":"